{
  "id": "arcane_arquebus",
  "item": "omnira:arcane_arquebus",
  "title": "Arcane Arquebus",
  "text": [
    "Sneak-right-click to load one Target-Projectile or Crosshair-Projectile crystal. Right-click with the gun in your main hand to cast the loaded spell. This bypasses the grid sequence and preserves the crystal.",
    "Range, spell power and projectile speed bonuses require the main hand. Each shot multiplies base mana cost before applying reductions. One kit fits each gun. Installation preserves the loaded crystal. The table gives selection range in blocks and base mana multiplier per shot."
